flowchart TD
    A["POST /api/reports/generate/{scan_id}"] --> B[Pydantic validates report metadata]
    B -->|Invalid| C[Return 422 validation error]
    B -->|Valid| D[Load scan]
    D -->|Missing| E[Return 404 scan not found]
    D -->|Found| F[Load vulnerabilities for scan]
    F --> G[Load recommendations linked to those vulnerabilities]
    G --> H[Calculate severity and recommendation summaries]
    H --> I[Gather scan timing and target metadata]
    I --> J[Build structured report content]
    J --> K[Persist report linked to scan]
    K --> L[(reports table)]
    L --> M[Return report ID and summaries]

    N["POST /api/reports/{report_id}/export"] --> O[Validate JSON, HTML or PDF format label]
    O -->|Invalid| P[Return 400]
    O -->|Valid| Q[Update export format and timestamp]
    Q --> R[Return export metadata]

    S[CLI: ./ptas.sh report --scan-id ID] --> T[Generate database report content]
    T --> U[Write JSON report]
    U --> V[Render standalone HTML report]
    V --> W[Optional browser Print to PDF]

    NOTE[The API export endpoint records export metadata;<br/>the terminal report command writes the JSON and HTML files]
    NOTE -.-> R
